rged JSON into a job dir that doesn't exist yet. Let me fix the test.Let me verify imports, then run the targeted tests and the coordinator's native-boundary probe.Coordinator's native-boundary probe now **2 passed** (defect 1 verified). Waiting on the targeted tests.All 6 targeted tests pass. Now the coordinator's real-owner crash/resume probe and the full owned suites.While those run, let me confirm the per-entry `Analyzer` is bound to the scan token.Full owned suites: 17 passed. Waiting on the coordinator's real-owner probe.2 failed, 2 passed. Let me confirm which passed and compare with the coordinator's newest probe results (to classify the failures as the known probe-prep issues).…Let me read my full probe-run log to confirm which passed.Both confirmed defects are verified by the coordinator's own probes (probe 4 foreign-JSON and native_boundary resume passed); the 2 failures are the known probe-prep issues. Let me add an owner-spawned in-flight verification adapted to `source_root=\".\"`.Now run the scratch owner probe plus the broad regression.While those run, let me get the exact diff for the 3 authorized pre-existing Black spots.Let me apply the 3 authorized local Black fixes.……Let me wait for the running probes/regression.The owner probe reached the last assertion (analyzer cancel observed, no wait-expired). Let me check what `cancel_watchdog`/`scan_terminated` mean.…`scan_terminated` is expected on any cancel; only `cancel_watchdog` means the owner had to kill the scanner. Let me correct my scratch probe.Let me re-run the owner probe.…4 regressions in `test_scan_session_resume_svf.py` from my gating. Let me read those tests.The owner probe now stops cooperatively (`cancel_watchdog` absent) but the report lacks `completeness`. Let me read the merge test and the owner's report handling.The merge test pins the legacy C/C++ batch behavior — so my gate was too broad. Let me narrow it to only skip the global semantic model, and inspect the owner's report handling.Two findings: (a) the owner writes the report via `write_report_atomic`'s envelope, so my probe must use `read_report`; (b) my resume gate was too broad. Let me fix both.…Now fix the scratch probe's report decoding.Let me re-run the resume regressions, the native-boundary probe, and the owner probe.34 passed — the resume regressions and the coordinator's boundary probe are green. Waiting on the owner probe.Owner-spawned in-flight cancel probe **passed**. Now the final quality pass.……`scan_session.py`, `parallel_analyzer.py`, `scan_work.py` are now Black-clean. Let me Black the 3 test files I edited.Now the final verification: Black+mypy and the full regression on the frozen bytes.…mypy caught a missing `logger` in `scan_work.py`. Let me stop the regression, fix, and re-run.…Now re-run mypy/Black and the full regression.…mypy clean (354 files), Black clean. Let me capture SHAs/time while the regression runs.…**328 passed** on the final bytes. Now the coordinator probes on the frozen bytes, for the record.…Final probes: **5 passed / 2 failed** (the 2 are the known probe-prep issues). Let me verify the JUnit artifacts.Let me preserve receipts under unambiguous R2 names, then write the DELIVERY.Now let me write the updated DELIVERY.Let me confirm no background tasks remain and the workspace is quiescent.S01/S08 ScanSession 返修（R2）已完成并冻结。源码自 03:41 起未再变动，后台任务全部结束。\n\n## 修复的三个已核实缺陷\n\n**1. 真实 `resume` workflow 在实例路由前跑全局语义**\n`_handle_plan_resume_entries` 在 `run()` 决定 `instance_execution_mode` 之前执行，原来无条件调 `_ensure_semantic_phase`。现改为：非 Java 时**跳过全局语义模型**（其全局证据不得授权实例结果），Java 保留自身路径；历史 batch resume 的「按 entry 跳过 + merge saved report」逻辑保持不变，以保住 `test_scan_session_resume_svf.py` 的 4 个既有回归（初版我把它整段禁用，导致这 4 例 KeyError，已收窄修正）。\n\n**2. 外来 JSON checkpoint 可跳过真实队列**\n`load_checkpoint` 原来只看 schema/input_revision/report-dict。现改为**不自我授权**的严格校验：必须 `job_id`/`run_id` 等于当前尝试、`input_revision` 匹配、覆盖实例集合恰好等于当前计划、且**文件字节 SHA-256 匹配 job store 里真实的 `instance_checkpoint_persisted` 完成事件**；消费前再用 `stand_down_reason` 复核绑定。`persist_checkpoint` 在写文件后经真实 `JobStore.append_event` 落收据，写文件或写收据失败即未持久化（defer，报 incomplete/partial）。自述 hash/owner/complete 的 JSON 与篡改字节的 JSON 一律视为不存在。\n\n**3. 在途 token 未绑定；取消/截止不协作停止**\n原 `_bind_job_deadline` 在 `_build_instance_analyzer` **之后**替换 token，Analyzer 持有旧 token。现不再替换 token，并新增 `_start_job_window_monitor`（每 0.1s 读 hook）在 cancel/截止时取消会话 token，真实 `Analyzer.run`/entry token 随即可见；`run_instance_batch` 在已取消时抛 `CancellationError`（不伪造判定），handlers 返回 `WorkDefer` 使工作项保持 unresolved。另修一个真实死锁：取消路径 `close()` 等 `_active_batch_thread` 永不清（批次未走到 checkpoint），新增 `abandon_instance_batch` + `handlers.release()` 释放。\n\n**队列**：改回 **canonical** `<store>/<job_id>/work-queue.db`（对齐你们 owner 的读取），无可信 checkpoint 时删除该 job 的队列文件，使本次从干净队列重跑。\n\n## 核验\n\n协调者冻结探针（`…native-owner-probes-20261015`）+ 本地 owner 探针，共 **5 passed / 2 failed**：\n- ✅ `test_scan_session_native_boundary.py`（resume=False/True，缺陷 1）\n- ✅ `crash_resume::test_real_header_edit_revokes_…`、`::test_foreign_json_checkpoint_…`（缺陷 2）\n- ✅ 本地 `owner-probes/test_owner_inflight_owner_boundary.py`——**真实 ScanJobService owner 启动**，在途 `Analyzer.run` 被可取消等待替换：`cancel-observed.json` 出现、无 `wait-expired.json`、无 `cancel_watchdog`、报告 incomplete/partial、`pending.json` 有剩余（缺陷 3）\n\n两处失败**均为你们已声明的探针准备问题，非本产品缺陷**：① `test_durable_…resume` 在 `assert final[\"input_revision\"] == first_revision` 失败（`source_root=\".\"` 使扫描生成物进入被哈希的源根，即「source_root='.'扫描生成物令input变化」）；② 在途探针 `assert cancelled.status_code == 202` 失败（共享 cancel 实际返回 200，即「共享cancel实际200」——新版探针已改 200 并把队列断言换成 `pending.json`，我按新版语义在本地 owner 探针中通过）。\n\n其余：相关回归 18 文件 **328 passed**、自有两套件 **17 passed**、`mypy zscope` **0 issues/354 files**、`black --check` 5 个 owned 文件 **unchanged**（你们授权的 3 处既有局部 hunk 已按 Black 修正，两文件现完全干净）、`compileall` OK。JUnit：`artifacts/coordinator-probes-final.xml`(7/2fail)、`scan-session-r12-r2-related-regression.xml`(328/0)、`scan-session-r12-r2-owned-suites.xml`(17/0)。\n\n## 最终 SHA256（03:41 +0800）\n\n```\n19b266096d4f2301d2156999b969e81b1dd80b95222f2b1f0